{"nodes": [{"id": "_context_features_appointments_feature", "label": "Feature: Agendamentos (CRUD + status + vis\u00f5es)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "topo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_status_workflow", "label": "AppointmentStatus (PENDING\u2192CONFIRMED|NOT_CONFIRMED|CANCELED|NO_SHOW)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Regras de neg\u00f3cio", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NOT_CONFIRMED \u00e9 setado manualmente (a UI n\u00e3o o produz); NO_SHOW \u00e9 setado pelo cron. Dura\u00e7\u00e3o 5-480 min, default 30."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_overlap_allowed", "label": "Sobreposi\u00e7\u00e3o permitida (conflict.ts deletado)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Regras de neg\u00f3cio", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dois agendamentos no mesmo hor\u00e1rio s\u00e3o caso real (atendimento simult\u00e2neo, sala dupla) e a grade j\u00e1 os desenha lado a lado. Consequ\u00eancia positiva: a corrida de duplo-agendamento entre dois /convert simult\u00e2neos deixou de ser risco. Ao reintroduzir qualquer checagem, lembrar que a UI foi desenhada assumindo que sobrepor \u00e9 leg\u00edtimo."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_retroactive", "label": "Retroativo \u2014 agendar no passado", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "\u00a7 Retroativo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9 PERSISTIDO (Appointment.retroactive) e n\u00e3o derivado de dateTime < now na leitura: um agendamento marcado para o futuro que simplesmente passou tem de continuar sendo varrido pelo cron \u2014 \u00e9 exatamente a falta que o produto mede. Derivar na leitura mataria a m\u00e9trica de no-show. Revers\u00edvel: mover para o futuro limpa o flag."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_isretroactive", "label": "isRetroactive(dateTime) \u2014 regra \u00fanica no servidor", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "\u00a7 Retroativo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/lib/retroactive.ts, compara\u00e7\u00e3o estrita; usada por POST /appointments, PUT (s\u00f3 quando dateTime \u00e9 reescrito) e /convert. O cliente NUNCA envia retroactive (n\u00e3o est\u00e1 no schema Zod)."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_retroactive_born_classified", "label": "Retroativo nasce classificado (sem PENDING)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Nasce CLASSIFICADO (2026-07-25)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PENDING tem sem\u00e2nticas OPOSTAS nos dois casos: em agendamento normal \u00e9 transit\u00f3rio (o cron resolve), em retroativo \u00e9 TERMINAL (o cron pula). O dashboard n\u00e3o distingue, ent\u00e3o cada backfill em Pendente entrava no denominador de noShowRate/confirmationRate e dilu\u00eda a m\u00e9trica para sempre. Default 'Confirmado', sem op\u00e7\u00e3o 'Pendente'; POST s\u00f3 honra status quando retroactive \u00e9 true. Check RT.6."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_retroactive_transition_toast", "label": "Toast s\u00f3 na TRANSI\u00c7\u00c3O para retroativo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "\u00a7 Retroativo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Arraste \u00e9 gesto de baixa inten\u00e7\u00e3o para uma chave que remove o registro do controle de faltas (cl\u00ednica atrasada arrasta o card das 14h \u00e0s 15h). Armadilha de teste: o sonner pausa timers com o mouse sobre a pilha de toasts, ent\u00e3o soltar o card na faixa top-center esconde o toast novo."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_monthview", "label": "Vis\u00e3o M\u00eas (MonthView, grade fixa de 6 semanas)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o M\u00eas (2026-07-10)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Busca usa o MESMO range da grade (getMonthGridRange) \u2014 buscar s\u00f3 startOfMonth..endOfMonth deixa os dias que vazam dos meses vizinhos falsamente vazios. Cap de 3 chips ordena AGENDAMENTOS primeiro (eventos dia-inteiro do Google consumiam o cap e escondiam os itens acion\u00e1veis); loading overlay porque o branch do M\u00eas n\u00e3o passava pelo isLoading; timelinesByDay memoizado (era recalculado 42\u00d7/render)."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_monthcalendar", "label": "Mini-calend\u00e1rio (MonthCalendar) + pontos nos dias", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Mini-calend\u00e1rio (2026-07-04)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grid sempre 42 c\u00e9lulas para a altura do popover n\u00e3o pular ao paginar; a query dos pontos cobre a GRADE vis\u00edvel inteira (dias vazando dos meses vizinhos s\u00e3o clic\u00e1veis \u2014 buscar s\u00f3 o m\u00eas criaria falso 'dia livre') e s\u00f3 roda com o popover aberto (options.enabled)."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_timeselect", "label": "TimeSelect (2 selects Hora/Minuto)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Seletor de hor\u00e1rio custom (2026-07-18)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "<input type=\"time\"> abre o rel\u00f3gio Material nativo do Android (overlay gigante que cobre o di\u00e1logo). Fix de review: s\u00f3 emite HH:mm quando as DUAS partes est\u00e3o escolhidas (incompleto emite \"\" e o Zod barra) \u2014 a 1\u00aa vers\u00e3o assumia \"00\" e criava silenciosamente agendamento em 00:30/HH:00. Estado local + useEffect guardado por lastEmitted ref ignora o eco do pr\u00f3prio emit."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_unified_actions", "label": "A\u00e7\u00f5es unificadas nas 3 vis\u00f5es (janela de edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 o \u00fanico lugar de a\u00e7\u00e3o)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "A\u00e7\u00f5es unificadas (2026-07-10)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O menu \u22ee por-card foi removido: Dia/Semana s\u00f3 trocavam status por ele e o M\u00eas n\u00e3o tinha nenhum. dialogStatusOptions prepende o status atual se ele n\u00e3o estiver na lista (ex. NOT_CONFIRMED) para 'Atualizar' nunca trocar o status silenciosamente por um default."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_status_only_if_changed", "label": "status entra no PUT s\u00f3 se mudou", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "A\u00e7\u00f5es unificadas (2026-07-10)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Regress\u00e3o de perda de dados pega no code-review: enviar sempre o valor capturado ao abrir a janela sobrescreveria uma mudan\u00e7a feita pelo servidor no meio-tempo (paciente confirma no WhatsApp / cron de no-show), revertendo o status ao salvar uma edi\u00e7\u00e3o de observa\u00e7\u00f5es."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_mobile_overflow_fix", "label": "Fixes de overflow horizontal no mobile (S24+)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Corre\u00e7\u00f5es mobile (2026-07-18)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mesma raiz para badge cortado e 'tilt' ao rolar: overflow-x-hidden no <main> + min-w-0 na coluna flex + px-4 sm:px-6 nos cards. Regress\u00e3o a evitar: o overflow-x-hidden s\u00f3 \u00e9 seguro porque nada depende de scroll horizontal no <main> \u2014 conte\u00fado largo novo precisa do pr\u00f3prio wrapper overflow-x-auto."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_export_csv_entitlement", "label": "Export CSV \u00e9 entitlement pago (ExportCsvButton)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Pontos sens\u00edveis \u2192 Export CSV", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes era <a href download> cru e no Free o browser mostrava falha gen\u00e9rica; agora o clique faz fetch (401\u2192signOut, 402\u2192PaywallModal soft com reason validada, ok\u2192Blob com filename do Content-Disposition). Cadeado s\u00f3 quando !usage.isLoading para PRO n\u00e3o ver cadeado piscando."}, {"id": "_context_features_appointments_app_timezone_day_boundaries", "label": "Boundaries de dia via startOfDayInAppTz/endOfDayInAppTz", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": "Pontos sens\u00edveis", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "new Date(y,m,d,0,0,0,0) em runtime UTC (Vercel) vira meia-noite UTC = 21:00 BRT do dia anterior (drift de 3h). Export CSV idem: formatInTimeZone em vez de toLocaleDateString sem timeZone."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_features_appointments_feature", "target": "_context_features_appointments_status_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/appointments.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_appointments_feature", "target": "_context_features_a